            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/286000/extras/000939a8b8f71688d4332a37fa97e448.avif?t=1789252757\" width=620 height=90 /></span><br>Lead the revolution with an army of flamethrowing Boars, mustard gas-lobbing Skunks, and paratrooper-puking Owls.  <i>Tooth and Tail</i> is a Real-Time-Strategy game featuring Single Player, Online Competitive Play, Split Screen, Replays, and more.<br><br>Build a base, lead your army, eat your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The War for Meat</h2>The Longcoats, the Commonfolk, the KSR, and the Civilized are in the midst of a Civil War over who gets to eat, and who has to be the meat.  A darkly humorous tale of riots and revolution is told through an extensive Single Player campaign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Replayability</h2>With procedurally generated maps and customizable factions, no two conflicts will be the same, forcing players to strategize rather than memorize.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick-up-and-Play</h2>With matches lasting from 5-12 minutes, controls designed specifically for the gamepad, and split-screen couch play, Tooth and Tail is a popcorn RTS for veterans and newcomers alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/286000/extras/e2f36300e8c181dc19cf43156f96c5b2.avif?t=1789252757\" width=620 height=182 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/286000/extras/000939a8b8f71688d4332a37fa97e448.avif?t=1789252757\" width=620 height=90 /></span><br>Lead the revolution with an army of flamethrowing Boars, mustard gas-lobbing Skunks, and paratrooper-puking Owls.  <i>Tooth and Tail</i> is a Real-Time-Strategy game featuring Single Player, Online Competitive Play, Split Screen, Replays, and more.<br><br>Build a base, lead your army, eat your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The War for Meat</h2>The Longcoats, the Commonfolk, the KSR, and the Civilized are in the midst of a Civil War over who gets to eat, and who has to be the meat.  A darkly humorous tale of riots and revolution is told through an extensive Single Player campaign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Replayability</h2>With procedurally generated maps and customizable factions, no two conflicts will be the same, forcing players to strategize rather than memorize.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick-up-and-Play</h2>With matches lasting from 5-12 minutes, controls designed specifically for the gamepad, and split-screen couch play, Tooth and Tail is a popcorn RTS for veterans and newcomers alike.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/286000/extras/e2f36300e8c181dc19cf43156f96c5b2.avif?t=1789252757\" width=620 height=182 /></span>",
            "short_description": "Lead the revolution with an army of flamethrowing Boars, mustard gas-lobbing Skunks, and paratrooper-puking Owls. Tooth and Tail is a Real-Time-Strategy game featuring Single Player, Online Competitive Play, Split Screen, Replays, and more. Build a base, lead your army, eat your enemies!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Coreano, Chinês simplificado, Italiano, Espanhol (Espanha), Chinês tradicional, Alemão, Português (Brasil), Russo, Turco, Francês, Holandês, Ucraniano, Polaco<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
