                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's still getting updates? Wow, holy cow. Very fun little RTS. It's much simper than starcraft or warcraft - but that's not a bad thing. The game is super active and you don't spend much time waiting for anything really. \n\nIn terms of game design, A really interesting case study on how limitations and simplifying the game can make it much more fun and deep. \n\nThe art and story is fantastic too. The setting actually really interesting. It takes a lot of inspiration from western classics like watership down, animal farm, and rats of nimh. \n\nProbably a top 3 modern rts. Must play, even for those not in the genre.",
